    {
      "id": "return_from_meridian_welcome",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "arrived_meridian"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "text": "Outpost Balor. You're back — but the place feels different. Tenser. The perimeter patrols have doubled, and there are new scorch marks on the outer walls."
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sol_grid_tutorial_reminder",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "received_sol_unit"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "sol_tutorial_shown"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "setFlag",
          "flag": "sol_tutorial_shown"
        },
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "Your Sol Unit is equipped. Press [I] to open Inventory and click OPEN on the weapon slot to access your Sol Grid.",
            "Place the Damage Booster chip next to the Sol Beam for a power boost. Modifiers enhance whatever they're adjacent to."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "outside_warning_no_sol",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "talked_to_warden"
        },
        {
          "not": {
            "hasFlag": "received_sol_unit"
          }
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "A cold wind howls through the north gate. Beyond the outpost walls lies the dark perimeter — open ground with no light, no shelter.",
            "You'll need a Sol Unit before heading out there. The Workshop engineer can set you up with one."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_entrance_shutdown",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_shutdown"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "Outpost Balor without the Array. The automated status displays on the walls are dark. Hand-drawn patrol schedules have replaced the holographic duty board.",
            "A group of Unbounded visitors sit in the courtyard, teaching manual relay calibration to a cluster of soldiers. Laughter — actual laughter — echoes off the stone walls.",
            "It's rougher here now. More hands-on. But the air smells different — less recycled, more real. Like the outpost is breathing on its own for the first time."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "setTile",
          "x": 15,
          "y": 15,
          "tileId": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "setTile",
          "x": 16,
          "y": 15,
          "tileId": 2
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_entrance_merge",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_merge"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "Outpost Balor is changed. Thin tendrils of bioluminescent growth trace along the base of the walls — not damage, but integration. The Underlumen network reaching into human spaces.",
            "The Array terminals still hum, but their displays show three-way data feeds now: human, Array, biological. Soldiers pass an Unbounded liaison in the corridor with a nod.",
            "The outpost feels alive in a way it never did before. The walls themselves seem warmer."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "endgame_entrance_control",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hasFlag": "endgame_active"
        },
        {
          "hasFlag": "chose_path_control"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "showMessage",
          "lines": [
            "Outpost Balor under Ring Authority. New equipment racks line the corridors — Array-spec hardware, now stamped with the Ring emblem. The suppression field emitters on the roof pulse with a low, steady hum.",
            "The soldiers stand straighter. Better armed, better supplied, better connected to Command. The perimeter sensors show green across the board.",
            "Everything runs smoother now. The only thing missing is the sound the Underlumen used to make — that deep, rhythmic pulse through the ground. It's been suppressed to silence."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "once": true
    }
  ]
